        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Raw Iron x4 — 40 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_raw_iron"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_raw_iron_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Raw Copper x4 — 24 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_raw_copper"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_raw_copper_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Raw Gold x4 — 64 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_raw_gold"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_raw_gold_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "That is all for now",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You hear the one about the auditor? Bramm down at the ledger office swears his own signature got scratched off the star-count and somebody else verified it in his place. Wild, right? Do not tell him I told you, he is touchy about it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I haul more than coal off this landing, friend — I run raw ore off the reject pile the Company will not weigh. Straight off the wagons, cheaper than the mart, no questions and no verified surcharge. What are you smelting?"
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Sorry, I talk when I haul, it passes the time. Watch your step on the coal — it is loose here and blacker than a Company promise."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Fresh one for you: that vault the Company guards down the low gallery is already empty. My cousin loads the night wagons, and he says the guard is standing watch over an echo. You did not hear it from me."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Mirek Coalstain",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
